%% Title: MediSearch Warehouse Loading Flow
flowchart LR
  Raw[Raw Data Bucket] --> Profile[Data Profiling]
  Profile --> Clean[Clean and Validate]
  Clean --> Stage[Staging Bucket]
  Stage --> Conform[Conform Dimensions]
  Conform --> DimLoad[Load Dimension Tables]
  DimLoad --> FactBuild[Build Fact Tables]
  FactBuild --> FactLoad[Load Warehouse Facts]
  FactLoad --> Quality[Warehouse Quality Checks]
  Quality --> Marts[Analytics Marts]
  Marts --> BI[Dashboards, Reports, AI Features]

  OLTP[(Operational DB)] --> Incremental[Incremental Extracts]
  Incremental --> Conform
